### 1. Register customer
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "banana123",
  "phone": "5551234"
}

### 2. Add Bananas (id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bananas", "description": "Fresh yellow bananas", "price": 1.29, "image": "banana.jpg", "quantity": 100 }

### 3. Add Milk (id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Milk", "description": "Whole milk 1 gallon", "price": 3.49, "image": "milk.jpg", "quantity": 50 }

### 4. Add 2 Bananas to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/1/add/1?quantity=2

### 5. Add 1 Milk to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/cart/1/add/2

### 6. Checkout (STANDARD delivery, no discount)
POST http://localhost:8080/checkout/1

### 7. View order history
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1